== Usage ==
'''Watering Cans''' can retain water to be used on [[Crops (disambiguation)|crops]] in the [[Greenhouse]]. They have up to {{Green|3}} abilities depending on their [[Rarity|rarity]]: 

* {{AN|Hydrate}} dispenses between {{Aqua|150}} and {{Aqua|350}} water per second.
* {{AN|Fill}} refills the '''Watering Can''' to capacity, which goes between {{Aqua|3k}} and {{Aqua|20k}} water.
* {{AN|Aquaburst}} allows the player to water multiple crops at one, in a {{Green|2x2}} or {{Green|3x3}} area.

